7737406407970816618297.jpeg/OG67CwggFcAbZvX6ZYd2ZQS-mvAOeNqJl015pJdNeaQ\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737408945655808640721.jpeg/IGVlIhX0ojXPHLDdW-EoNjmdgBl6saySumNikrpjYpI\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737411269431296045978.jpeg/I-aHpaLIMK3XEzmdWRUZ96g3M4uAn2j1Xw1_Ql8Nf0I\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737403769622528160432.jpeg/ZY1rwdJ4gm_etEOL45XsnKRvYIvNCTCdnSR5oJ0keaA\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737406479273984658427.jpeg/KwlFp7GlFpppSkuz6il4k3pbnLimoEFM1Ie-EtSHvhI\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737408966627328530987.jpeg/zt1s8cbRR7n-KgT2QwNNECoc9v1hy5fHbsseNG7LHjQ\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737401127079936296843.jpeg/ztTC7UzY_MsJawj5K9PsWSgWYFOQMwyhv2GDp79hg6c\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737406357639168316459.jpeg/OHF54HJkO087c9OGaelvBu3ekn73_eluS4-DcEuPg3A\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737403060785152083491.jpeg/k6gNh_siAnicuDuSUpf5c6YKEKwLa23La9p5K2vaeSs\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240516/867737408740134912458927.jpeg/eKY3FRSvzfsZ20tzLMPyP8TabuwJCzWoRZhRdUWYUXU\"/><figcaption>美國TikTok網紅勞拉（IG@lauratwyford_）</figcaption></figure><p>結帳刷不過遭「8+9」酸手機破…他無奈吐實情 對方下一步超暖</p><p>鹽吃太多當心「腦細胞被吃掉」！醫示警：血壓會剎不住直飆</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T14:40:39.809877+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1888,"images":28,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}